# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the root `.dockerignore`,
# which is what lets this image be built from the repository root even though the root
# file excludes `pipeline/` for the web image's benefit.
#
# The context is the whole repo, so everything not needed is named here rather than the
# other way round: the point is that a change to the game's frontend must not invalidate
# this image's layers.
*
!pipeline/pyproject.toml
!pipeline/uv.lock
!pipeline/connectris_pipeline
!src/lib/data/puzzles.json
pipeline/connectris_pipeline/**/__pycache__
